  "abstract": "Combine two individually positive H=128 tweaks: static Mixture-of-Timescales head (R=4, \u03b1=0.07) and Huber(\u03b4=0.01) with curvature regularization. Tests whether gains add on the simple ScalarRamp baseline without harming early steps.",
